			"text": "SSI... Strength, Survival, and Intelligence, are the three key skills you will need to survive the desert. It's unfortunate you didn't already know this, especially now, but you should be paying attention to each of these... stats?.. as you are dealing with new challenges. Pick and choose which one to focus on at a time.",
